<node id="Transformer Model Architecture Diagram (image)">
  <data key="d0">Transformer Model Architecture Diagram (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This diagram illustrates the Transformer model's architecture, highlighting its encoder-decoder structure with multi-head attention and feed-forward layers. It visually supports the text's explanation of the Transformer's reliance on self-attention for efficient sequence modeling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-092c273bae013ebc89cad8ff5987f7ca</data>
