<node id="Multi-Head Attention Equation (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Head Attention Equation (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines the Multi-Head Attention mechanism in Transformer models, enabling the model to jointly attend to information from different representation subspaces, thereby improving its ability to capture complex dependencies in sequence data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b29928fafd4b36b14db3c1808710d46b</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763841259</data>
</node>
<node id="Feed-Forward Neural Network Layer (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Feed-Forward Neural Network Layer (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines a feed-forward neural network layer, crucial for transforming input data through linear and non-linear operations, enhancing the model's ability to learn complex patterns in tasks like sequence transduction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ceeec139be6fabfa98d8121bfe789a6f</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
