  <data key="d0">Adaptive Learning Rate Equation (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines the adaptive learning rate for training transformer models, balancing the model's dimensionality and training step progression to optimize learning efficiency and stability.</data>
