<node id="Comparison of Machine Translation Models (table)">
  <data key="d0">Comparison of Machine Translation Models (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table compares BLEU scores and training costs of various machine translation models, highlighting the superior performance and efficiency of the Transformer models over previous state-of-the-art architectures in English-to-German and English-to-French translation tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7c0b03bbe7026f7c01f629104201ab0</data>
